<title>INDIA: Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - April 7.</title>
<headline>Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - April 7.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is an analysis of the 30-share Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) index movement in trading upto (0700 GMT) on Monday.</p>
<p>The table shows the stocks which moved the index most during this period and their percentage contribution to the net change.</p>
<p>The latest index was 3525.48, 24.89 points or 0.70 percent lower than Friday's close.</p>
